==============================================================================
                    UPDATE NOTICES (PHONE HOME)
==============================================================================

The Zshot tray process sends exactly { instanceId, version } to
https://updater.zopen.vn/zshot/v1/ping 30 seconds after start and every 12
hours, and shows the announcement returned (new version, security notice).
instanceId is a random id created once per installation. Nothing else is sent
and the central page does not record IP addresses. Source code of both sides:
src/core/phonehome.cpp and deploy/phone-home-worker.

